# Two parallel trails on the same side (game/trail_occlusion.h): the nearer hides the farther
# completely, so the farther isn't drawn there. Ride north 3 s (trail A), left: west 1 s, left:
# south 4 s (trail B, 420 west of A, reaching past A's start), left: east 2 s (round A's start),
# left: north again 420 east of A, with B 840 away beyond it. The radar shows the layout.
wait 17
wait 3
press left
wait 1
press left
wait 4
press left
wait 2
press left
wait 0.5
shot par_1
wait 0.4
shot par_2
wait 0.4
shot par_3
wait 0.4
shot par_4
wait 0.4
shot par_5
wait 0.4
shot par_6
